--- !u!114 &399241350
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 399241348}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9541d86e2fd84c1d9990edf0852d74ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshPro
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<size=130%><b><color=#ffd970>AREA 2 - LIGHTING</color></b></size>

    A
    campsite at midnight showing each kind of light: <b>Directional</b> (moon), <b>Point</b>
    (campfire, fairy lights), <b>Spot</b> (floodlight), <b>Ambient</b> (sky colour)
    and <b>Emission</b> (tent).


    <b><color=#9fe3ff>TRY THIS</color></b>

    <size=92%>1.
    Turn the moon off. How dark is it with only Ambient light?

    2. Change the
    floodlight''s Spot Angle to 15, then 90.

    3. Lighting window: make the Ambient
    Sky colour dark red. What mood does it give?</size>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
